  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A set of static D3.js HTML reports, built by the paplot CLI from tabular result files, for checking per-sample sequencing QC, looking at where chromosomal-aberration breakpoints fall in each sample, and browsing a gene-by-sample mutation matrix that can be sorted and filtered without running the tool again. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
